OL,3,ASwimmer, 65, killed in shark attack off
OL,4,ASouth Africa's east coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FA South African woman has been killed
OL,7,Fin a shark attack off the country's
OL,8,Feast coast, in what is the first
OL,9,Frecorded such fatality this year.
OL,11,FJanine Lochrenberg was swimming off a
OL,12,Fbeach in KuGompo City (formerly East
OL,13,FLondon) on Tuesday morning when she was
OL,14,Fattacked.
OL,16,FWitnesses said the 65-year-old was
OL,17,Fbitten in two places and died before
OL,18,Fshe was brought to shore.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
