OL,3,ASwimmer, 65, killed in shark attack off
OL,4,ASouth Africa's east coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FShark attacks are rare in South Africa,
OL,7,Fwith about 10 fatal ones since 2012,
OL,8,Faccording to the Florida Museum's
OL,9,FInternational Shark Attack File.
